    Bug 2036140 - Request the offline_access scope when authenticating Graph API calls using OAuth2. r=edicharry


    It turns out Microsoft only provides refresh tokens if the `online_access` scope
    is requested. Without a refresh token, we have nothing to persist, and we need
    to authenticate from scratch again next time Thunderbird starts.

    I've also added a few more debug logs to the OAuth2 code that I found helpful to
    investigate this bug.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297717

